---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<Layout title="The Playbook for America">

  <main>

    <header class="bg-p4a-bg0 mb-18 drop-shadow-xl">
      <div class="container py-16 md:py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl text-p4a-bg4 font-bold leading-18">
            Connecting people to ideas — and ideas to <span class="text-white ">real results</span>.
          </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-white font-semibold leading-15 tracking-wide">
            P4A is a nonpartisan platform to shape crowdsourced ideas into structured proposals, ready for people and institutions to deliver real results.
          </h2>
          <div class="text-center">
            <a
              href="https://airtable.com/appH0YK3BFKCCfUVB/pagERE8ylQTG39EZN/form"
              target="_blank"
              class="inline-block"
            >
              <button class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-p4a-bg3 hover:bg-p4a-bg4 hover:text-p4a-bg0 text-white border border-p4a-body font-bold px-36 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                Share your perspective <Icon class="text-2xl" name="ph:arrow-right" />
              </button>
            </a>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-1">4-minute anonymous survey · All viewpoints encouraged</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container pb-8">

      <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">How it works</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">Free access for all Americans, launching in 2026.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4">
          <Icon class="text-4xl -mt-1 text-p4a-bg3" name="ph:number-circle-one-fill" />
          <div class="">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold">Crowdsource ideas</div>
            <div class="">
              Anyone can submit, discuss, and help improve ideas to address real public challenges.
              Promising ideas gain visibility through constructive dialogue and broad participation.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-p4a-bg1 flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4">
          <Icon class="text-4xl -mt-1 text-p4a-bg3" name="ph:number-circle-two-fill" />
          <div class="">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold">Refine into structured proposals</div>
            <div class="">
              The strongest ideas are evaluated, debated, and shaped into clear, implementation-ready proposals.
              Structured sections, evidence, and defined implementation paths ensure seriousness and feasibility.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-p4a-bg1 flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4">
          <Icon class="text-4xl -mt-1 text-p4a-bg3" name="ph:number-circle-three-fill" />
          <div class="">
            <div class="text-xl font-bold">Activate to deliver real programs</div>
            <div class="">
              People and institutions collaborate to turn proposals into actionable programs with measurable public benefit.
              Execution teams, defined scope, and clear ownership move ideas from discussion to delivery.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Why it matters</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">
          Most Americans want to improve how government works and strengthen civic life — but far fewer feel invited or equipped to act on their ideas.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">
          Too often, good ideas get lost in noise, partisanship, or lack of clear pathways to implementation. Discussion is easy. Real progress is harder.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          A healthier democracy requires better ways to surface promising ideas, refine them constructively, and move them into action.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Get involved</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Help shape the future of Playbook for America. Share your perspective, stay informed as the platform develops, or express interest in contributing your time or expertise.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
    
  </main>

</Layout>